  "description": "Buy the Dip? Wait? Short? What should we do?",
  "body_html": "<p>The last time the White House had an Oval Office announcement, it shook the market in the lead up…and then once everyone realized it was just an announcement about SpaceForce (nothing black swan-like), the market resumed its uptrend. Today’s announcement turned out to be about IVF access. My speculation is we will resume going upwards, pending no drastic negative news. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"775\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:775,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1700522,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/176365232?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4GoO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84bad925-7511-42ea-b5c3-693f218e4e32_3628x1932.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Still in a bull market, and locally speaking, the S&amp;P 500 appears to be making higher lows. </figcaption></figure></div><p>However… <strong>REGARDLESS of my speculation, or anyone’s…until the S&amp;P 500 gets above $6812, I will be doing nothing. We want confirmation that the general market is in fact in an uptrend, making highs, and that the odds are favorable. Additionally the VIX is greater than 22…which is an “all-stop” for me, and the StockTok Screener. </strong>The screener is less effective in bearish, high volatility regions…by turning it off during this time, we won’t damage the wins we have achieved over the year. </p><p><em><strong>Is it time to short?</strong></em> Maybe, but I will not be…not yet. Recall in my post titled <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-stock-purchases-when-to-short?r=4z8lgl\">When To Short</a>, we are only meeting 1 of 4 requirements (the VIX &gt;22). The S&amp;P 500 is NOT making lower lows, no popular stocks have had a major crash, and most mid-caps remain above their 200 day moving average. We are still, by definition, in a bull market. I am excited to short Costco and Netflix in the near future 😏.</p><p>I am largely, <strong>doing nothing for the time being</strong>. <strong>I remain cash heavy</strong>, having sold off most positions around September 30th, due to the flashing warning signals. Warnings were provided:</p><ul><li><p>September 29<sup>th</sup>: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-warning-signal?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Warning Signal</a></p></li><li><p>September 30<sup>th</sup>: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-guessing-game?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Guessing Game</a></p></li><li><p>October 3<sup>rd</sup>: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/why-stock-market-caution-is-critical?r=4z8lgl\">Why Stock market Caution is Critical</a></p></li><li><p>October 7<sup>th</sup>: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-meltdown-reminder?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market Meltdown Reminder</a> (I don’t think this is the meltdown, just high volatility)</p></li></ul><p>So…the warnings were given and updates made in the StockTok tracker. I am saying this because I don’t want to hear any bitching. When the market starts working for us again, we will throw money at it. Until then, it would just be too much risk and guessing. If you have questions, <strong>feel free to ping me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eba49e1c-42ba-410f-9f01-4540686d65aa\">Main Chat</a></strong> during market hours. <em><strong>Regardless, a quick update on the few positions I do currently hold:</strong></em></p>",
